THIRD-PARTY LICENSES
====================

akku is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see `LICENSE`).

This file lists third-party open-source code adapted into akku (`fork` modules
or portions of modules). Only MPL-2.0-compatible licenses (MIT, Apache-2.0,
BSD, ISC, MPL-2.0; never GPL/AGPL) may be adapted. Keep the packaged copies in
`crates/akku/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES`, `crates/akku-drive/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES`,
and `crates/akku-cli/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES` identical to this root file.

Entry format
------------

Add one section per adapted upstream crate containing:

- Crate name
- Version or commit SHA
- Upstream URL
- SPDX license identifier
- akku files derived from it (repo-relative paths)
- Verbatim upstream copyright notice(s) and full license text
- Verbatim `NOTICE` text (required when adapting Apache-2.0 code that includes
  a `NOTICE` file)

Per-file header template
------------------------

Every akku source file that adapts upstream code carries this header at the top
of the file (adjusting the SPDX identifier and license name when the upstream
license is not MIT, e.g. `Apache-2.0`):

```rust
// SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0 AND MIT
// Portions adapted from <crate> v<version> (<url>):
//   Copyright (c) <Year> <Authors>
//   Licensed under the MIT License (see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES).
// Modifications for akku are licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0.
```

